    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0821",
      "reading_order": 1184,
      "section": "For remote starting and stopping:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 82.03,
        "t": 707.3899999999998,
        "r": 534.6865999999993,
        "b": 641.1039999999996
      },
      "content": "On compressors with an Elektronikon Graphic controller, bridge terminals 1 and 2 of connector (X109) (= DIO6 on the controller). In this mode, the outlet pressure is still sensed by pressure transducer (PT20), resulting in loading and unloading of the compressor at the pressures programmed in the Elektronikon regulator. If terminals 1 and 2 of connector (X109) are not bridged, the compressor is switched out of automatic load/unload operation and remains running unloaded.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1183",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_7",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_7",
          "title": "7       Operating instructions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1183",
          "title": "For remote starting and stopping:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 106,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0822",
      "reading_order": 1185,
      "section": "For remote starting and stopping:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 82.03,
        "t": 733.7899999999998,
        "r": 527.734600000001,
        "b": 707.1039999999998
      },
      "content": "Connect a start/programmed stop button (S1') between terminals 1 and 2 of connector (X108)(=DIO3 on the controller).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1183",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_7",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_7",
          "title": "7       Operating instructions"
