    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0823",
      "reading_order": 1186,
      "section": "For remote loading/unloading (via external pressure switch):",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 82.03,
        "t": 640.0809999999996,
        "r": 380.5204999999999,
        "b": 627.9039999999995
      },
      "content": "For remote loading/unloading (via external pressure switch):",
      "level": 2,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1186",
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_7",
          "title": "7       Operating instructions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1186",
          "title": "For remote loading/unloading (via external pressure switch):"
        }
      ],
      "parent_section_id": "sec_7",
      "section_level": 2,
      "page": 106,
      "chunk_hint": "section_heading",
      "semantic_role": "section_heading",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0824",
      "reading_order": 1187,
      "section": "For remote loading/unloading (via external pressure switch):",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 82.03,
        "t": 626.8809999999995,
        "r": 527.5959999999993,
        "b": 601.5039999999995
      },
      "content": "Compressors with an Elektronikon Graphic controller can also be wired to load and unload depending from the status of a pressure switch:",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1186",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_7",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_7",
          "title": "7       Operating instructions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1186",
          "title": "For remote loading/unloading (via external pressure switch):"
        }
      ],
      "page": 106,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0825",
      "reading_order": 1188,
      "section": "For remote loading/unloading (via external pressure switch):",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 82.03,
        "t": 601.7899999999994,
        "r": 534.6238999999985,
        "b": 548.7039999999993
      },
      "content": "Bridge terminals 1 and 3 of connector (X1 08a) (=DIO5 on the controller) and connect a load/unload (pressure) switch (S4') between terminals 1 and 2 of connector strip (X109) (= DIO6 on the controller). This results in loading and unloading of the compressor at the closing and opening pressures of the external pressure switch respectively.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_1186",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_7",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_7",
          "title": "7       Operating instructions"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_1186",
          "title": "For remote loading/unloading (via external pressure switch):"
        }
      ],
